   1  0000              ; NOTE: comments marked [AI] are machine-generated by claude-opus-4-8 from the code alone
   2  0000              ; and may be inaccurate; treat them as hints, not verified annotation. Comments marked
   3  0000              ; [DOC <manual> <page>] have been reconciled against the primary-source Microsoft SoftCard
