   5  0000              ; Details", CPMREF = the bundled Digital Research CP/M 2.2 Reference Manual. See the
   6  0000              ; consolidated fact sheet at ../../docs/CPM_Manual_Reconcile_Facts.md. The function
   7  0000              ; semantics are generic CP/M 2.2 and so apply unchanged to this 2.23 / 60K BDOS; the
